Where things came from

The recipes, patches and the two pacman helpers were moved here from
OrchardLinux/omarchy-a (commit aebcf01, 2026-11-15), where they were written.
Their history up to then is in that repository.

packages/mesa: Mesa, MIT; source https://github.com/OrchardLinux/mesa, license in the package.
  Recipe and gpu-probe.c (MIT): Henrik Klee.
packages/wlroots0.20: wlroots, MIT.
  Recipe: Arch Linux's wlroots0.20 PKGBUILD (Maintainer: Robin Candau), adapted by Henrik Klee;
  ARMv7 by Shayne Legault.
  patches/0001, 0002: Henrik Klee (authorship in each patch's header).
packages/labwc: Labwc, GPL-2.0-only.
  Recipe: after Arch Linux's labwc PKGBUILD (Maintainer: Peter Jung, Contributor: Lex Black) and
  omarchy-a's desktop/build-labwc (Henrik Klee; ARMv7 by Shayne Legault).
  patches/0001 to 0004: Henrik Klee.
  patches/0005: Berkay Kösebay (omarchy-a PR #46).
packages/qt6-base: Qt Base, LGPL-3.0-only / GPL-3.0-only (with exceptions), licenses in the package;
  source https://github.com/qt/qtbase, tag v6.12.0.
  Recipe and arch/qt6-base-*.patch: Arch Linux ARM's extra/qt6-base (archlinuxarm/PKGBUILDs 1117e0aaa6;
  Maintainers: Antonio Rojas, Felix Yan; ALARM: Kevin Mihelich, John), adapted by Henrik Klee.
  patches/0001: Inho Lee (Qt commit e26d5a8eee, as picked to 6.12: dc41c4eed4).
  patches/0002: David Edmundson (Qt commit b4dd527686, as picked to 6.12: 45df0ed09d).
packages/libva-v4l2-request: libva-v4l2_request, GPL-3.0-only; Ondrej Jirman and contributors,
  https://xff.cz/git/libva-v4l2_request. The archive beside the recipe is that repository's tree at
  commit cac6ece0e23ac1f944dd3af266680aff0c3184df (git archive); COPYING is in it and in the package.
  Recipe: Henrik Klee.
packages/omafox: Omafox, MIT; https://github.com/cover/omafox.
  Recipe and install script: upstream's (Maintainer: Fabio Cantoni); ARMv7 by Shayne Legault.
packages/omacalc: Omacalc, MIT, with a font under OFL-1.1; https://github.com/omacom/omacalc.
  Recipe: Shayne Legault.
packages/omactivity: Omactivity, MIT; https://github.com/OrchardLinux/omactivity.
  Recipe: that repository's pkgbuild/PKGBUILD (Henrik Klee).
packages/folio-touch: Folio, MIT; David Heinemeier Hansson and contributors, https://github.com/omacom/folio,
  with the touch mode of https://github.com/OrchardLinux/folio (Henrik Klee).
  Recipe: upstream Omarchy's (omacom/omarchy-pkgs pkgbuilds/folio, Maintainer: David Heinemeier Hansson)
  as OrchardLinux/folio's omarchy-a branch packaged it (pkgbuild/omarchy-a, Henrik Klee).
ci/rank-mirrors, ci/pacman-download: Henrik Klee, from omarchy-a.

The armv7h build container is Arch Linux ARM's official root archive of 2026-08-05, fetched from the
copy in OrchardLinux/omarchy-a's releases and checked against the SHA-256 in ci/containers.json.
